---
---
<section class="research" id="research" aria-labelledby="research-title">
  <div class="container research-inner">
    <div class="research-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Research</p>
      <h2 id="research-title">Research grounded<br />in real workloads.</h2>
      <p>We're validating causal diagnosis for LLM inference with engineers working through difficult performance problems. Bring a workload where the cause is hard to isolate and a proposed change can be checked against a baseline.</p>
      <a href="/submit" class="button">Share your workload <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="research-details">
      <div class="research-status">Research preview <span>Accepting workloads</span></div>
      <div class="research-row"><span class="eyebrow">Today</span><p>A research-stage CLI for causal diagnosis, with evidence-backed rules and a reviewed path to a verified fix.</p></div>
      <div class="research-row"><span class="eyebrow">Next</span><p>A connected optimization and control layer across the data center stack.</p></div>
      <div class="research-row"><span class="eyebrow">Together</span><p>Send a redacted Nsight or DCGM capture. We'll review the workload and share the diagnosis with you.</p></div>
      <a class="text-link contact-link" href="mailto:hello@strided.dev">Prefer a conversation? Get in touch <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .research { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); padding-block: 84px; }
  .research-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 100px; }
  .research .eyebrow { color: var(--strided-bezel-dark); }
  .research-copy .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .research-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { font-size: 14px; color: var(--strided-bezel-dark); margin-top: 23px; max-width: 390px; line-height: 1.85; }
  .research .button { background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--paper); margin-top: 30px; }
  .research .button:hover { background: var(--strided-bezel-dark); border-color: var(--strided-bezel-dark); }
  .research-details { padding-top: 8px; }
  .research-status { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 28px; font-size: 12px; }
  .research-status > span { font-size: 11px; margin-left: auto; color: var(--strided-bezel-dark); }
  .research-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 72px 1fr; gap: 24px; margin-top: 28px; }
  .research-row .eyebrow { padding-top: 2px; font-size: 12px; }
  .research-row p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--strided-bezel-dark); }
  .contact-link { font-size: 11px; margin-top: 28px; gap: 15px; }
  .research :focus-visible { outline-color: var(--paper); }
  @media (max-width: 950px) { .research-inner { gap: 50px; } }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .research { padding-block: 65px; } .research-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 50px; } .research-row { gap: 15px; } }
</style>
